  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4f75d5e09c35c7a967b5142223b3f4bb76021a43.png\" alt=\"橫幅\" width=\"1846\" height=\"1046\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblueprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://tinyurl.com/ycyjpbeb&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"需要 Blueprint\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6uRtghgWnE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/780149719611473930?color=526557&amp;label= &amp;labelColor=54ab6b&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/rosevcook/windswept\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-Team_Galena?label=&amp;color=b68e45&amp;labelColor=ba472b&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Github\"></a></p><h3>📖 關於：</h3><ul>\n<li>Windswept 是一款原版擴展模組，大幅豐富了遊戲中的寒冷地區。它新增了苔原、松林、栗樹林、薰衣草田和繁花稀樹草原等生態域，以及新的花朵、敵人和更多內容——基本上是與冬季相關的大量內容！</li>\n</ul><h3>📖 跨模組內容：</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaverns-and-chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a> - 銅質妖精燈、凍肉塊、寒冰幽靈會穿著銀製盔甲生成、乾苔蘚鵝卵石磚/瓦</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> - 蜂蜜/巧克力木桶</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fberry-good\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berry Good</a> - 野莓種子</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fboatload\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boatload</a> - 新增木材種類的額外船隻變體</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgallery\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gallery</a> - 全部七幅畫作的物品紋理</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a> - 新增木材種類的木製方塊變體</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fendergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Endergetic Expansion</a> - 終界妖精燈</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwoodworks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Woodworks</a> - 新增木材種類的木製方塊變體、所有木材方塊的鋸木機配方</li>\n</ul><h3>📖 附加模組：</h3><ul>\n<li>正在尋找 Farmer's Delight 相容模組嗎？我們有自己的附加模組，名為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/windswept-delights\" rel=\"nofollow\">Windswept Delights</a></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4c86b8d891d9f5d0e9cfdc7107650064397368fa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"228\"></p>",
